From: Julius Bairaktaris <julius@bairaktaris.de>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:41:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] clk: qcom: gcc-ipq8074: enable parents across the crypto clock switch

An enabled NSS crypto root clock needs the target PLL running when
device tree clock defaults select it. Keep the clock parents enabled
across the RCG update so the hardware can complete that switch.

Split from:
  34a8bd60de0f (qualcommax: enable parents while switching ipq8074 nss_crypto_clk_src)

Signed-off-by: Julius Bairaktaris <julius@bairaktaris.de>
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>

--- a/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-ipq8074.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-ipq8074.c
@@ -1198,6 +1198,7 @@
 		.name = "nss_crypto_clk_src",
 		.parent_data = gcc_xo_nss_crypto_pll_gpll0,
 		.num_parents = ARRAY_SIZE(gcc_xo_nss_crypto_pll_gpll0),
+		.flags = CLK_OPS_PARENT_ENABLE,
 		.ops = &clk_rcg2_ops,
 	},
 };
